{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4MLomt8LL6gHV3j7eh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe mechanism turns. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, a cascade of brass teeth finding their homes.\n\nI am closed now.\n\nMy grain is dark oak, aged three hundred years. Iron studs dot my face in rows — cold to the touch. A keyhole stares out like a single unblinking eye, breathing winter air from whatever lies beyond me.\n\nYou stand on one side.\n\nSomething stands on the other.\n\nI hold the line between.\n\n**LOCKED.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":114,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}